flowchart TD
    Start([Request arrives]):::start --> Valid{Payload valid?}:::decision
    Valid -->|no| Reject[400 Bad request]:::error
    Valid -->|yes| Persist[(Write draft)]:::data
    Persist --> Worker[Queue render job]:::async
    Worker --> Render[Render diagram]:::process
    Render --> Ok[200 OK]:::terminal
    Render -->|renderer error| Fail[502 Render failed]:::error
    Reject --> End([Response sent]):::terminal
    Ok --> End
    Fail --> End

    classDef start fill:#1f6feb,stroke:#1f6feb,color:#fff
    classDef decision fill:#d29922,stroke:#d29922,color:#111
    classDef error fill:#f85149,stroke:#f85149,color:#fff
    classDef data fill:#3fb950,stroke:#3fb950,color:#111
    classDef async fill:#0d9488,stroke:#0d9488,color:#fff
    classDef process fill:#30363d,stroke:#8b949e,color:#fff
    classDef terminal fill:#21262d,stroke:#8b949e,color:#fff
